WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.757
Now the workloads, one by one,

2
00:00:01.757 --> 00:00:05.863
each with its target from the service
accounts guide's decision path.

3
00:00:05.863 --> 00:00:11.179
The SQL Server engine runs as
a user account or a G M S A,

4
00:00:11.179 --> 00:00:13.162
with an M S S Q L S V C S P N.

5
00:00:13.162 --> 00:00:16.010
Its G M S A stays the
Windows logon account,

6
00:00:16.010 --> 00:00:20.700
and the instance gets an Entra
identity: the Arc managed identity on

7
00:00:20.700 --> 00:00:25.474
SQL Server 2025, or an app registration
with a certificate on 2022.

8
00:00:25.474 --> 00:00:28.472
Users and applications then
sign in with Entra logins;

9
00:00:28.472 --> 00:00:31.936
Microsoft Learn lists
non-interactive mechanisms including

10
00:00:31.936 --> 00:00:35.400
managed identities for SQL
Server's Entra authentication.

11
00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:37.539
Users reach it through Private Access,

12
00:00:37.539 --> 00:00:41.750
but the engine's Kerberos stays on the
island until its logins are Entra-only.

13
00:00:41.750 --> 00:00:44.899
Applications that call SQL Server run as a

14
00:00:44.899 --> 00:00:47.800
user account or a G M S
A with a Windows login.

15
00:00:47.800 --> 00:00:52.285
Their target is a managed identity, or
a service principal with a certificate,

16
00:00:52.285 --> 00:00:54.388
with an Entra login in SQL Server,

17
00:00:54.388 --> 00:00:57.612
so the connection moves from
Kerberos to an Entra token.

18
00:00:57.612 --> 00:01:00.812
That's server to server, so
it's not in the SASE path.

19
00:01:00.812 --> 00:01:04.537
I I S sites and application pools run as a

20
00:01:04.537 --> 00:01:08.037
user account or a G M S
A with an H T T P S P N.

21
00:01:08.037 --> 00:01:13.337
Their target is a G M S A now, and a managed
identity when the site moves to Azure.

22
00:01:13.337 --> 00:01:18.403
Users sign in with Entra through
application proxy or Private Access,

23
00:01:18.403 --> 00:01:21.547
with Kerberos single sign-on
to the H T T P S P N,

24
00:01:21.547 --> 00:01:26.090
and the pool's own calls to Microsoft
A P Is use an Entra identity.
